fed pants, and dark sneakers with white laces.\n<Subject 3> is the modern living room in <Picture 3>, featuring a large flatscreen TV displaying a glowing blue AI interface with a cute robot avatar, a beige sofa, a wooden coffee table and TV stand, warm floor and table lamps, an evening city view through a window, and a cozy rug on light wood flooring.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> sitting together in <Subject 3>, discussing AI with curiosity and excitement. The emotional arc moves from the girl's proud announcement through the boy's skeptical surprise to their shared wonder as the TV interface glows, lasting 10 seconds. No subtitles, captions, or on-screen text of any kind appear in the video.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - short black hair, blue hooded sweatshirt, dark blue cuffed jeans, blue-and-white sneakers.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - black ponytail, pale yellow ribbed sweater, dark blue cuffed pants, dark sneakers with white laces.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - modern living room layout, TV with glowing blue AI interface, beige sofa, wooden furniture, warm lamps, evening window view.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a warm cinematic 3D-animated family style with soft practical indoor lighting, a cozy domestic color palette, and gentle depth of field. No on-screen text, subtitles, or captions appear in any shot.\n[Shot 1] A medium shot establishes <Subject 3>, the modern living room with its large flatscreen TV displaying a glowing blue AI interface, beige sofa, wooden coffee table and TV stand, warm lamps, and evening city view through the window. <Subject 2>, the young girl with a black ponytail and pale yellow ribbed sweater, sits on the sofa and points excitedly toward the TV while turning to <Subject 1>. <Subject 1>, the young boy with short black hair and a blue hooded sweatshirt, sits beside her and turns his head toward her with curious eyes. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. <Subject 2> (S1) says with bright, playful enthusiasm, <d>[Chinese] 我会用AI啦！</d> She closes her lips into a proud smile and keeps her finger pointed at the screen.\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a close-up of <Subject 1> (S2), the young boy in the blue hoodie. His eyes widen slightly and his eyebrows lift as he processes what he just heard, shifting from skeptical to intrigued. The camera holds static. <Subject 1> (S2) says in a soft, questioning child voice, <d>[Chinese] 真的假的？</d> He leans forward a little, his lips parted in anticipation.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, the shot cuts to a medium shot of both children in <Subject 3>. <Subject 2> (S1) smiles and raises a small remote control toward the TV. The AI interface on the screen brightens and pulses with a warm blue glow that reflects on their faces. Both children turn their gaze to the screen, eyes wide with wonder. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. <Subject 2> (S1) says eagerly, <d>[Chinese] 你看着！</d> Then <Subject 1> (S2) and <Subject 2> (S1) gasp together, <d>[Chinese] 哇——</d> their faces lit by the screen's glow.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft evening room tone with gentle traffic murmur from outside continues throughout the scene. The fabric of the sofa and the children's clothing rustle subtly as they shift positions. A quiet electronic hum emanates from the TV screen.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 454, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [639], "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314], "p